WEBVTT

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.050
<i>Hey, Mel.</i>

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.060
<i>I wonder if the Capital is farther away</i>
<i>than the stars.</i>

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:38.740
<i>Drown out the sound</i>
<i>Of a budding wish</i>

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.290
<i>With your cries</i>

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.000
<i>-There is no hope</i>
-Excuse me.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.260
Miss Finis and the Court Orchestra
have begun their performance.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.920
-What?
<i>-Despair is our only savior</i>

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.550
So, the sky looks unusual
because of the power of songs?

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:03.100
-What's happening to the sky?
<i>-The light that is gone</i>

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.600
Could it be...? Finis...

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.560
We're almost at the Capital!

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.610
-Rin! I'm entrusting Finis to you.
<i>-Will shine no more</i>

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.860
-Here we go. Begin the invasion!
<i>-Alas! It shines no more</i>

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.450
<i>If everything is an illusion</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.540
<i>Then everything shall disappear</i>

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.210
<i>The true state of the world</i>
<i>Returning to nothingness</i>

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:29.630
What's that?!

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.920
-The star... It's so close!
<i>-If everything is destiny</i>

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.170
Don't panic! What's going on?

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.590
-Something's coming from the sky!
<i>-Then everything shall disappear</i>

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:41.970
That's... No way...

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:46.520
<i>-Life was created to be guided to a world</i>
-We're going to take back the Capital!

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:53.900
<i>That ceases to exist</i>

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.950
The Song of Beginning

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.410
What did she do?

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:09.250
The song reached the star.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.630
The star won't stop anymore.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.550
Everything will disappear.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.720
Everything will finally end.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:25.140
What's going on? What did Finis do?

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.230
She already finished singing
the Song of Mortality.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.310
What did you say?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.480
Leobolt's army is already surrounding
the palace!

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.570
They're after the royal family.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.200
Activate the new Symphony Killer!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.200
Just as I thought,
the palace isn't closely guarded.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.580
Units 1 through 3, cover us from above!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.210
All other units,
prepare for the guerilla attack!

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.000
-Make sure to evacuate the people!
-Okay!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.000
Commence operations!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.460
All right. You guys, come with me.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.840
We're gonna rescue the king before
this place turns into a battlefield!

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:03.430
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.640
-Where's the Star Song Festival?
-At the Starry Arc!

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.600
Then we should keep heading west.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.980
That star...

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.400
It's too close!

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.610
It's closer than it was a moment ago.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:20.150
You don't think... it's because
of the Song of Mortality, do you?

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.740
Hey! Over there!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.240
That's the Court Orchestra.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.790
Why are they leaving the Starry Arc?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:31.500
All right!

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.290
Rin, you get to Finis first.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.840
We're going to meet the Court Orchestra.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.630
This way, we can stop
the Song of Mortality.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.470
-But...
-Why don't we have them

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.140
play the Song of Healing, Rin?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.220
-Your dream could come true.
-It could.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.140
You guys...

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:55.690
Thanks.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.820
I'm going to go where Mr. Leobolt is.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.320
I'll do what I can.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.870
That's what a man would do.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.500
Al...

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.710
Rin...

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.500
I... Rin...

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:27.800
I believe in you, Rin.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.240
I believe in you, too.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.990
The king's chamber is over here!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.410
If we can save him,
we can rebuild the Capital!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.580
What happened?

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.130
We meet again, Leobolt!

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.520
Hey, hey!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.360
What's that huge thing?!

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.530
The bloodline of the royal family
is now extinct!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.240
Bazra! What have you done, you bastard?!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:33.080
Don't worry.
The Kingdom of Golt will not fall.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.370
I will change everything.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.380
I won't let anyone get in my way!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.290
This is bad, Leader!

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.260
Unit 3, shoot!

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:47.340
Fools.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.760
Unit 3! Arrows don't work!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.010
Avoid the front when you--

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.810
This isn't the same
as the one Weissen made.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:05.400
This is a real weapon of war!

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.670
We finally meet.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.650
I've come to save you, Finis.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.860
The Song of Mortality reached the star.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.830
Why did you sing it?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.080
A world without him...

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.580
is meaningless.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.590
What? You're wrong!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.090
No way... Then it really...

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:14.850
The Song of Mortality has already
been sung.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.430
Good grief! Why did you go and play it?!

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:21.730
You guys have always been unable
to read the situation.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:24.230
Who are you?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.320
How dare you forget a member
of the royal family!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.110
The royal family?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.900
-Who are you talking about?
-Me.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.200
Don't listen to her.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.830
She's a bit crazy.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.450
What do you mean, crazy?
You mean, crazy beautiful?

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.620
Don't tell lies at a time like this...

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.420
Pat! Alond! Have you forgotten me?!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:47.000
How do you know our names?

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:48.960
Could it be?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.590
Are you the missing--?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.760
Come on. I thought
you'd recognize me right away.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.480
I'm the first princess
of the Kingdom of Golt, Alea Golt.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.190
Pony is a princess?! Who's Alea?!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.110
-It's my real name.
-What about Pony?

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.230
It's my nickname.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.780
-What about Goodlight?
-It sounded cool.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:13.820
What do you mean?!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.910
Now that I look closely...

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.280
But...

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.740
The princess was known
as the Amber Maiden.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.330
She has aged--
I mean, matured in five years...

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.080
Are you saying I look old?!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:25.630
I-- I didn't say anything!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.380
This conversation means...

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:28.590
she's real!

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.050
Seriously?

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.260
I don't know if we can make it,

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.510
but let's all go help perform Rin's song!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.140
Units 2 and 5 have been taken out!

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.650
Its armor is too strong!

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.400
We have to try a kamikaze attack!
It's better than just getting shot down!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:52.940
Don't be stupid! I won't let you throw
your life away for nothing!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.950
But...!

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:58.530
I have an idea!

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.410
Al!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.040
It's too dangerous here!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.370
Nowhere is safe anymore!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.790
So, what are you going to do, boy?!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.670
I'm going to destroy the core,
where Bazra is.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.460
If I wear the flight device,
then I can fly away

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.260
and escape before crashing
this miniature flying ship!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:17.890
Oh, wait!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:19.600
Al!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.060
Mr. Leobolt and everyone,
you guys lure Bazra!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.060
No! It's too dangerous!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.560
Unless we do this, there's no tomorrow!

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.820
I promised Rin.
So, I'm going to do it, no matter what!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:36.530
I'm going to do it!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.660
Finis, you're wrong.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.540
You could never understand how I feel.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.750
There's no such thing
as a meaningless world.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:54.050
-There's no world that's okay to erase!
-You've never lost someone you loved!

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.010
You don't know anything.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.180
I still can't forget.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.720
But I was the only one
who was left behind here.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:06.810
Forever.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.770
I can't take it anymore.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.360
I'm the same...

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.410
I lost someone I loved.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.500
I could never forget.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.620
I can't.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:33.130
<i>I don't want</i>
<i>to lose anyone I love ever again.</i>

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.090
<i>I want the people I love to be happy.</i>

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:39.090
<i>That's why I want to protect them.</i>

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.390
Hey, Finis.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.180
Why do you keep singing
the Song of Mortality?

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.890
You don't actually want to sing it.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:50.520
You don't actually want
to erase the world.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.860
-I...
-I heard you say, "Help me!"

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:57.900
You wanted me to help you, right?

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.780
I heard you.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:03.820
I heard you.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.290
I heard you!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.330
Why do you--?

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:17.210
Because... I'm your Song of Healing.

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.970
<i>Your feelings towards</i>
<i>the person you loved.</i>

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.060
<i>Your feelings towards</i>
<i>the person you loved.</i>

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.270
<i>The feelings you threw away anyway.</i>

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.980
That light from back then...

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.200
That's why I'm going to sing, Finis.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.500
It's dangerous here! Evacuate!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:57.960
Run away!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.800
General Bazra has gone mad!

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.680
The Capital will fall!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.310
Are you okay, Your Highness?

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.060
What's going on?!

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.690
The palace was blown away.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.570
Luckily, you landed in the waterfall.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:21.320
Wh--? Where's my father?
Where's the King of Golt?!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.910
Bazra... You traitor!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.790
I'll destroy them all!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.330
Here he comes!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.630
No matter how much you run,
I know where you are.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:45.720
As long as I have this Symphony Killer--
No, this Symphony Fortress.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.350
--I'm going to become an invincible king.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.430
You're not fit to be a king!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:53.560
Shut up! You worthless piece of trash!

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.520
I don't need the palace anymore!

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:57.730
No way.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.480
This Symphony Fortress will be
the new Capital.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:05.820
-Disappear!
-Now!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.780
-Al!
-The power of the Song of Wind

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.200
and all the Star Bombs I got!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.450
Take this!

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:19.540
Al!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:20.540
Yes!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.130
-We did it!
-Great!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.260
That explosion must have destroyed
the core!

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.810
Al!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.480
What a waste! That brat died for nothing!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.860
Bazra!

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:51.910
No matter how many times you try,
the result will be the same.

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.090
You can't reach me.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.380
You can't reach me,

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.130
Leobolt!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:11.260
Disappear.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.720
Take this!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.730
-What?
-Al.

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.730
Mr. Leobolt!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.950
You... You bastard...

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.240
Who are you?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.580
I'm Al.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:39.500
Al Hawkray!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.840
Hawkray?

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.400
The Song of Healing
and the Song of Mortality...

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:14.580
There must be a reason that they have
the same Graphic notation.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:19.500
I think I know now,

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.710
Al.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.550
Are you okay?! Al, your chest...

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:35.260
What's that?

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.310
I succeeded in miniaturizing it.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.110
You're safe!

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:48.940
Master?!

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:52.320
Master!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.740
You did a good job.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.250
We have to hurry. I'm going to find Rin!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.460
Wait!

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.420
There's something I have to tell you...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.890
Allu... The star is so close...

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.220
This is bad.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:20.430
<i>A song that awakens and calls</i>

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:25.150
<i>People repeat the song in their hearts</i>

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.360
Is that the Song of Healing?

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.530
<i>Drown out the sound of a budding wish</i>

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:37.120
<i>With your cries</i>

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:39.790
The Song of Mortality...

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.540
Two songs in one Graphic notation...

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:49.670
<i>Into the sky</i>
<i>From which the light has disappeared</i>

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.840
<i>-I wish to shine despair</i>
<i>-I wish to shine love</i>

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.970
I see. So, that's what it means.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:03.600
The Song of Healing
and the Song of Mortality...

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.770
They used to be one song.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.980
<i>Rin is going to disappear?</i>

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:16.740
Rin's existence is
the Song of Healing itself.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:19.700
That means when her song...

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:24.710
When her feelings reach Finis's heart,
the song that is Rin will be over.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.670
In terms of a human life,
that means death.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:33.920
Saving Finis means saving the world.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:38.470
<i>But even if she succeeds, Rin will...</i>

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:42.430
No way. No way!

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:41.370
<i>A song that awakens and calls</i>

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:45.200
<i>Drown out the sound of a budding wish</i>

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:50.670
<i>People keep making mistakes</i>

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.880
<i>Into the sky</i>

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:57.170
<i>From which the light has disappeared</i>

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:03.470
<i>-I wish to shine love</i>
<i>-I wish to shine despair</i>

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:10.730
<i>On the journey of no end</i>

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.940
<i>The light</i>

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:17.480
<i>That is gone</i>

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:19.240
<i>Will shine no more</i>

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:23.160
<i>-The meaning of this life</i>
<i>-It shines no more</i>

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:29.450
<i>Will be swallowed by darkness</i>

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.830
<i>If everything is an illusion</i>

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:36.880
<i>The world is a ship</i>

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:41.720
<i>If everything is destiny</i>

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:48.770
<i>-The waves sweep it away</i>
<i>-Sweep it away</i>

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:02.490
<i>That's why I made her wish come true.</i>

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:08.370
<i>The land</i>

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:11.330
<i>Where the flowers bloom</i>

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:15.080
<i>-For the ship that is the world</i>
<i>-Surely</i>

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:18.170
<i>Will come again</i>

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:21.260
<i>My voice</i>

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:24.220
<i>Shall echo</i>

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.930
<i>Far and wide</i>

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:30.310
<i>-So that we can forgive each other</i>
<i>-So that we can forgive</i>

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:31.560
<i>Now</i>

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.850
<i>The flowers bloom</i>

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.900
<i>And the birds sing</i>

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:40.480
<i>People will continue</i>

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:46.240
<i>To sing together again</i>

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.430
<i>The Capital got to work rebuilding itself.</i>

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.850
<i>Henry Leobolt was appointed</i>
<i>the new general.</i>

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:59.190
<i>And Alea Golt became the new queen.</i>

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:04.030
<i>It's funny to think that Pony is a queen.</i>

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.700
<i>Allu and Monica returned to their hometown</i>

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:11.330
<i>and are living peacefully</i>
<i>with their mother.</i>

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:15.750
<i>The town is popular</i>
<i>for its fun music-loving sisters</i>

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.040
<i>and its delicious food.</i>

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:25.050
<i>The Master enjoys living in seclusion,</i>
<i>staying in his laboratory.</i>

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:28.380
<i>What is he making?</i>

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:30.840
<i>I'll leave it up to your imagination.</i>

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:37.390
<i>I decided to conduct research</i>
<i>in the Capital,</i>

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:39.850
<i>succeeding Dr. Weissen.</i>

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>The youngest, most famous scientist</i>
<i>in the history of the Kingdom of Golt.</i>

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:49.240
<i>That's what they call me. Amazing, right?</i>

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:53.530
<i>And...</i>

00:22:55.370 --> 00:22:56.450
Finis!

00:22:57.870 --> 00:22:59.710
What are you doing here by yourself?

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:01.630
Are you lost again?

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:02.710
Corte.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:06.710
I'll protect you.

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:09.800
But you're the only one

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:11.760
who can protect your child.

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:17.850
<i>Hey, Rin.</i>

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:24.020
<i>I can hear you singing.</i>

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:32.110
<i>Your songs changed the destiny</i>
<i>of the stars.</i>

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:38.410
<i>Your songs have always been there.</i>

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:45.090
<i>Your songs...</i>
